usage: vt089_load.py [-h] --base-url BASE_URL --listing-id LISTING_ID
                     --account-count ACCOUNT_COUNT [--vus VUS]
                     [--requests-per-vu REQUESTS_PER_VU]
                     [--warmup-requests WARMUP_REQUESTS]
                     [--timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS]

Opt-in 120-VU HTTP harness for a disposable VT-089 environment. Bearer tokens
are read only from VT089_BEARER_TOKENS_JSON and are never printed. This script
does not create data or change database state; prepare representative fixtures
through the repository's disposable-database runbook before using it.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base-url BASE_URL
  --listing-id LISTING_ID
  --account-count ACCOUNT_COUNT
  --vus VUS
  --requests-per-vu REQUESTS_PER_VU
  --warmup-requests WARMUP_REQUESTS
  --timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS
